@startuml
!include ../styl.iuml
[*] --> SUSPENDED : task_create_raw()
SUSPENDED --> READY : sched_ready() (kthread_create, proc_thread_create)
READY --> READY : tick (kwant), yield, wywłaszczenie
READY --> BLOCKED : sched_block() (mutex, sem, event, sleep, IPC, poll...)
BLOCKED --> READY : sched_wake(wynik), limit czasu (-ETIMEDOUT), task_kill (-EINTR)
READY --> DEAD : task_exit()
DEAD --> [*] : sched_reap() w kworker
@enduml
